{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant, <strong>PS2-inspired 3D action-platformer</strong>, a young Felko named Azzy sees his world flipped upside down by the sudden disappearance of his father and the emergence of an ancient, all-consuming Darkness. Thrust into a grand adventure, <strong>Azzy</strong> must channel the synergistic power of the elements through his trusty bionic arm, collecting upgrades and fighting to restore balance to the corrupted lands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.poster.avif?t=1762529340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.webm?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/38a0dfc4e420442ce3c6d3b938567dd0.mp4?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World, Master the Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through <strong>five distinct, sprawling elemental villages</strong>\u00a0in your quest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.poster.avif?t=1762529340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.webm?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/19036a89096a212049e9d47c72e7a421.mp4?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every location, you'll encounter new <strong>residents</strong> who uncover local lore, and consult with <strong>their resident Engineer</strong> who provides essential elemental upgrades. As you explore environments uniquely designed around their local element, you will unlock new parts of Azzy's arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Dark Crystals scattered throughout the world to unlock new powers and upgrade Azzy's bionic arm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.poster.avif?t=1762529340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.webm?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/90b0ee9185723d6fa22426475664e59d.mp4?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.poster.avif?t=1762529340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.webm?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/689370/extras/8351aeb918e1912dcb0d40a23991ec57.mp4?t=1762529340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st